### IHub demo scenarios. Run with the VS Code REST Client extension, Visual Studio or JetBrains Rider.
### Start the stack first: docker compose up --build

@host = http://localhost:8080
@broker = BRK-DEMO-001
@from = 2026-10-01T00:00:00Z
@to = 2026-11-01T00:00:00Z

### 1. Submit two commissions for one broker -> both "Created"
POST {{host}}/api/v1/activities
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-step-1

{
  "activities": [
    {
      "sourceSystem": "life-admin",
      "sourceActivityId": "POL-1001-COMM",
      "version": 1,
      "intermediaryId": "{{broker}}",
      "activityType": "commission",
      "status": "Active",
      "amount": 1500.00,
      "currency": "ZAR",
      "occurredAt": "2026-10-05T09:15:00+02:00"
    },
    {
      "sourceSystem": "investments",
      "sourceActivityId": "INV-77-FEE",
      "version": 1,
      "intermediaryId": "{{broker}}",
      "activityType": "advice-fee",
      "status": "Active",
      "amount": 820.50,
      "currency": "ZAR",
      "occurredAt": "2026-10-12T14:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Statement -> ZAR gross 2320.50 from 2 activities
GET {{host}}/api/v1/intermediaries/{{broker}}/statement?from={{from}}&to={{to}}

### 3. Retry the exact same request (e.g. a network timeout) -> "Duplicate", total unchanged
POST {{host}}/api/v1/activities
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-step-3

{
  "activities": [
    {
      "sourceSystem": "life-admin",
      "sourceActivityId": "POL-1001-COMM",
      "version": 1,
      "intermediaryId": "{{broker}}",
      "activityType": "commission",
      "status": "Active",
      "amount": 1500.00,
      "currency": "ZAR",
      "occurredAt": "2026-10-05T09:15:00+02:00"
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Out of order: the cancellation (v3) arrives BEFORE the correction (v2) -> "Updated"
POST {{host}}/api/v1/activities
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-step-4

{
  "activities": [
    {
      "sourceSystem": "life-admin",
      "sourceActivityId": "POL-1001-COMM",
      "version": 3,
      "intermediaryId": "{{broker}}",
      "activityType": "commission",
      "status": "Reversed",
      "amount": 1500.00,
      "currency": "ZAR",
      "occurredAt": "2026-10-05T09:15:00+02:00"
    }
  ]
}

### 5. The late correction (v2) finally arrives -> "Stale", the reversal stands
POST {{host}}/api/v1/activities
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-step-5

{
  "activities": [
    {
      "sourceSystem": "life-admin",
      "sourceActivityId": "POL-1001-COMM",
      "version": 2,
      "intermediaryId": "{{broker}}",
      "activityType": "commission",
      "status": "Active",
      "amount": 1750.00,
      "currency": "ZAR",
      "occurredAt": "2026-10-05T09:15:00+02:00"
    }
  ]
}

### 6. Statement -> ZAR gross 820.50 (1 active, 1 reversed); lastUpdatedAt moved forward
GET {{host}}/api/v1/intermediaries/{{broker}}/statement?from={{from}}&to={{to}}

### 7. Same version, different content (a producer bug) -> "Conflict", not applied, warning logged
POST {{host}}/api/v1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activities": [
    {
      "sourceSystem": "investments",
      "sourceActivityId": "INV-77-FEE",
      "version": 1,
      "intermediaryId": "{{broker}}",
      "activityType": "advice-fee",
      "status": "Active",
      "amount": 9999.99,
      "currency": "ZAR",
      "occurredAt": "2026-10-12T14:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

### 8. Validation: whole batch rejected with field-level errors (400 problem+json)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activities": [
    {
      "sourceSystem": "life-admin",
      "sourceActivityId": "POL-2002-COMM",
      "version": 0,
      "intermediaryId": "{{broker}}",
      "activityType": "commission",
      "status": "Pending",
      "amount": -5,
      "currency": "XYZ",
      "occurredAt": "2026-10-05T09:15:00"
    }
  ]
}

